built_from: S85, mid-session, with AD_WITNESS=1 still a switch.
  RECORDED because this artifact does NOT rebuild from HEAD and the only thing
  that would otherwise say why is "HEAD at the time". Later in the same session
  the ad[0..2] witness became unconditional (hub ruling S84-N1) and the
  AD_WITNESS switch was removed, so the same RTL now labels differently. The
  FUNCTION is reproducible at HEAD from this artifact's other switch alone --
  the witness is in every build now -- and what changes is the label, not the
  lane path or the counters. The readings taken on this bitstream are in
  MW/D24/DSP/s85/launch-phase.md against the design ID above, which the part
  answered and MATCHED before any of them was taken.
